        "word_count": 77,
        "duration_sec": null,
        "body_text": "The 21st Bundestag of Germany was elected on 23 February 2025. The President of the Bundestag is currently Julia Klöckner (CDU). It has 630 members (down from 733 in the previous Bundestag). On 6 May 2025 Friedrich Merz (CDU) was chosen as Chancellor of Germany and sworn in. He failed to win enough support in a first round of voting – a first in German history for a chancellor candidate. == Parties == This is the composition of the 21st Bundestag as of May 2025: == References ==",
